---
const presentationUrl =
  "https://img.sakanano.moe/file/sakanano/public/slides/202503/index.html";
---

<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0;url=${presentationUrl}`} />
    <script define:vars={{ presentationUrl }}>
      window.location.replace(presentationUrl);
    </script>
    <title>Redirecting...</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #f5f5f5;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
          Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, "Open Sans", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
      }
      .container {
        padding: 2rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <p>
        正在跳转到演示文稿；如果没有自动跳转，请<a href={presentationUrl}
          >点击这里</a
        >。
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
